    "content": "urs.\"\n\nElara frowned. \"Kael, how can you be in Engineering right now? You are standing right here on the Bridge.\"\n\nKael didn't look up. \"Must be a glitch, Captain. I've been on the Bridge since 07:30.\"\n\nElara studied him. The jagged scar running down his left cheek seemed to glow in the red emergency lighting. It was a souvenir from the siege of Titus IV, a mark he refused to heal.\n\n\"I need the decryption key,\" Elara said. \"The Red Onyx Key. You logged it out of the armory.\"\n\n\"I have it right he",
